From b0a080cbe88258ea503d3c614b509c9b91d3f5f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vanetiaho <vangs.vanetia@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 06:44:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Cooler name, bigger everything, 3D redo, glass graph,
 Spotify
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Hero name now uses Bricolage Grotesque (extrabold) instead of the
  default heading font, and is bigger still; the flying-plane hover
  animation is bigger too. Role text gets a drop-shadow so it doesn't
  blend into the sunset-toned background behind it.
- Every ✈︎ glyph across the site (section labels, navbar mark, cursor,
  entrance flyover, scroll indicator) sized up ~1.5x.
- 3D hero completely redone: a rounder, chubbier otter with aviator
  goggles (torus lenses + strap) sitting on a toy-airliner-style plane
  (capsule fuselage, cockpit window, passenger windows, engines, tail
  fin) instead of the low-poly otter + paper plane. Went through one
  placement pass to fix the otter's paws initially looking like they
  were sticking out sideways instead of resting on the fuselage.
- Favicon redrawn without the dark background square — just the otter
  face, transparent background, bigger/rounder proportions.
- GitHub activity graph rebuilt with a glassmorphism treatment:
  backdrop-blur panel, inset/glow box-shadows per contribution level
  so it reads as backlit glass tiles instead of flat pixels.
- Wired up the real Spotify profile link.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
